'''Cow Cat''' is the 5th [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cat]], available to unlock after completing [[Singapore (Empire of Cats)|Singapore]] in [[Empire of Cats]] Chapter 1 and requires 4,000 XP or a [[Cat Capsule|Normal Cat Capsule]] to unlock. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 2.0 Update|Version 2.0]] doubles health and attack power and increases recharge time.

