==Trivia==
*[[Version 2.0 Update#Version 2.0.4 Update|Version 2.0.4]] reduced Lion Cat's base health from 1,500 to 1,000 and base attack from 39 to 26, and increased base recharge from 270f<sup>9s</sup> to 390f<sup>13s</sup>.
*Prior to [[Version 4.7 Update|Version 4.7]], Giraffe Cat was a part of two other [[Cat Combo]]s: [[Cat Army MkII (Removed Combo)|Cat Army MkII]] and [[Maxed Out (Removed Combo)|Maxed Out]].
*Cow Cat's pre-Version 15.5 description referred to him as a male, even though in reality, cows are female.
*Cow Cat was the only [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cat]] whose equivalent in [[Kumanchu Royale]] differed in usage: Missile Bear and RobobearRX48 would perish after attacking like [[Glass Cat (Rare Cat)|Glass Cat]], rather than being able to attack continuously.
*One of the enemies in Kumanchu Royale was a [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] version of Cow Cat introduced in [[Spain (Empire of Cats)|Spain]], which would technically make him the first [[Cat Units|Cat Unit]] to have an enemy counterpart.
*Prior to [[Version 15.5 Update|Version 15.5]], Cow Cat's descriptions read as follows:
<pre>Cow Cat
Thinks quick, acts quick, and uses his head.
Runs like the wind! </pre>
<pre>Giraffe Cat
Thinks quick, acts quick, and uses his head.
Headbangs only to Rock'n'Roll! </pre>
<pre>Lion Cat
Thinks quick, acts quick, and uses his head.
Uses his mane to clean the house. </pre>

